^["stream"]{
 >>[2026-07-20] observe — typescript-toolchain-observatory planned profile/matrix scripts but none exist under scripts/analyzers (no typescript-profile.ts).
 >>[2026-07-20] observe — fuzz:types is only `npx tsc -p tsconfig.typecheck.json --noEmit` with no duration or version identity.
 >>[2026-07-20] observe — TS 7 is stable; --checkers/--builders/--singleThreaded are real knobs worth matrix rows after dual-install.
 >>[2026-07-20] decide — this plan is the executable first slice of the observatory: single-run + matrix + package scripts; projection polish can remain observatory-owned.
 >>[2026-07-20] decide — keep audit scripts separate from fuzz:types so ship gates stay binary while perf stays comparative.
 >>[2026-07-20] taste — a good audit row should answer: which compiler, which config, how long, did it pass — without narrative fluff.
 >>[2026-09-30 16:54] decide — reheated to planning beside cli-benchmarking-infra. Compiler identity rows are performance scrutiny, not a prelude to the upgrade ladder. Editor startup work stays dormant until a retained sample exists.
 >>[2026-10-12 14:37] observe — measured by hand on one machine, TypeScript 5.9.3, npx tsc -p tsconfig.typecheck.json --noEmit run three times back to back: wall times 6.28 s, 6.27 s, 6.17 s, all exit 0. That is about a 2 percent spread warm; a cold-process run was not measured. No scripts/analyzers/typescript-perf.ts or audit:ts:perf script exists yet, so ~[2]..~[6] are all still open. The repo has no CI configuration (no .github or equivalent at the root), and node_modules/.cache is git-ignored while .agents/state is tracked.
 >>[2026-10-12 14:37] revise — ~[1] landed in a333db8d and moved to ^[done]. ?[ci_gate] resolved (non-gating: no CI config exists and the 2026-07-20 decision keeps audit scripts apart from fuzz:types) and moved to ^[done]. ?[cache_location] and ?[median_runs] sharpened with the facts above; a wonder added for the cold-versus-warm spread, the one unmeasured input to ?[median_runs].
 >>[2026-10-12 15:31] revise — Commits named per the convention in 90c58bbc: 1 landed, 5 planned, 0 dropped.
}

